          "schedule_entity": "Optional. A Home Assistant schedule (Settings, Devices & services, Helpers, Schedule) drawn as a weekly grid. The button \"Copy schedule to the stove\" then sends it to the stove. Two time ranges per day at most."
        }
      }
    }
